      "displayText": "Dopodiché gettò <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003>\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᔌ<U+0004><U+0001><U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0004> nell’Antro Talassico di Kalos!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 12,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F0070006F006400690063006800E90020006700650074007400F200200010000201020003000A00100003150C0004000100100002010200040020006E0065006C006C20190041006E00740072006F002000540061006C00610073007300690063006F0020006400690020004B0061006C006F0073002100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Di fronte a questa scena, <U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>, che\ngovernava i misteri della megaevoluzione...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 6232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>... decise di conferire la megaevoluzione\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᔎ<U+0000><U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> per premiare la forza da l<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāuei<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ndimostrata!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 16,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 6400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 110
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La prima megaevoluzione del genere umano!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 6620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00610020007000720069006D00610020006D00650067006100650076006F006C0075007A0069006F006E0065002000640065006C002000670065006E00650072006500200075006D0061006E006F002100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alla luce di questo miracolo, <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002>\nritornò speranzoso...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 6712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C00610020006C007500630065002000640069002000710075006500730074006F0020006D0069007200610063006F006C006F002C00200010000201020002000A007200690074006F0072006E00F2002000730070006500720061006E007A006F0073006F002E002E002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... e decise di mettersi nuovamente a cercare la\nsua personale Megapietra!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 6836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
